Instalar app 1.3.39 (bucket main, 64bit)
  1. Instalar o lançador de comandos em C:\W\shims\.launcher\shim.exe
  2. Baixar [1] https://acli.atlassian.com/windows/1.3.39-stable/acli_1.3.39-stable_windows_amd64.zip (acli_1.3.39-stable_windows_amd64.zip, sha256 c43c6f9ceae7458efafb62b1cb0cff0287774d2d0780672fc0f718e161e4edfd)
  3. Extrair [1] acli_1.3.39-stable_windows_amd64.zip para C:\W\apps\app\.staging-1.3.39 (só a subpasta acli_1.3.39-stable_windows_amd64)
  4. Mover C:\W\apps\app\.staging-1.3.39 para C:\W\apps\app\1.3.39
  5. Apontar C:\W\apps\app\current -> C:\W\apps\app\1.3.39 (junção)
  6. Criar comando acli em C:\W\shims (acli.exe + acli.shim) -> C:\W\apps\app\current\acli.exe
  7. Garantir C:\W\shims no PATH do usuário
  8. Registrar app 1.3.39 (main) em C:\W\state.db
